dsh-miloco-bridge
=================

This repository is an independent, unofficial integration between
DeepSeek Harness (DSH) and Xiaomi Miloco.

What this repository contains
-----------------------------
- Original Node.js/JavaScript code for a native DSH plugin.
- Original Chinese Skill documents written for this plugin. They describe how
  to use this plugin's own tools; they are not copies of Xiaomi Miloco's
  Skill documents.
- An original, duck-typed `agent_platform` adapter that talks to DSH's HTTP
  webhook. It does not import or vendor Xiaomi Miloco backend code.

What this repository does NOT contain
-------------------------------------
- No Xiaomi Miloco source code, binaries, model files, dashboard assets, or
  documentation is redistributed here.
- No Xiaomi logo or other trademark is used to endorse this project.

